1
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:48,020
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:51,000
[Episode 10]

3
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:52,680
The promo video's about to play.

4
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,620
Don't mess it up.

5
00:01:54,370 --> 00:01:55,180
Tingting.

6
00:01:55,930 --> 00:01:57,280
Sort out the products over here.

7
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,340
Remember the set for the guests.

8
00:01:58,340 --> 00:01:59,009
Okay.

9
00:01:59,330 --> 00:02:00,550
Don't just wipe the outside!

10
00:02:00,550 --> 00:02:01,690
Clean the inside too.

11
00:02:01,690 --> 00:02:02,790
They're watching.

12
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:06,480
Shoot well, Nana.

13
00:02:06,510 --> 00:02:07,310
Memory card's swapped out.

14
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:08,080
Don't worry.

15
00:02:09,070 --> 00:02:09,880
Feifei!

16
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,060
Why are you here?

17
00:02:14,580 --> 00:02:16,150
It's my bestie's big day.

18
00:02:16,170 --> 00:02:18,270
Of course I have to come and support you.

19
00:02:18,270 --> 00:02:18,990
Thank you.

20
00:02:19,020 --> 00:02:20,750
I'll find you a good seat later.

21
00:02:22,030 --> 00:02:24,680
This outfit looks so good on you.

22
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,410
It really suits you.

23
00:02:31,310 --> 00:02:33,210
Isn't that Yun Li?

24
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,520
Do you know her?

25
00:02:36,570 --> 00:02:37,070
Yeah.

26
00:02:37,090 --> 00:02:38,890
We were high school classmates.

27
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:42,060
What a coincidence.

28
00:02:42,550 --> 00:02:44,210
She works at your company too?

29
00:02:44,970 --> 00:02:46,560
Just an intern.

30
00:02:47,110 --> 00:02:48,710
So she's your subordinate.

31
00:02:49,210 --> 00:02:50,540
What is she in charge of?

32
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:53,000
What else could she be in charge of?

33
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,130
Playing mascots, handing out flyers,

34
00:02:55,150 --> 00:02:56,210
and doing odd jobs.

35
00:02:56,970 --> 00:02:57,780
Yun Li

36
00:02:57,780 --> 00:02:59,310
is still the same as ever.

37
00:02:59,310 --> 00:03:01,750
Pretending to be so innocent,

38
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:03,310
but she never takes initiative,

39
00:03:03,310 --> 00:03:04,120
nor does she say no.

40
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,280
She's on good terms

41
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,560
with all the boys.

42
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:09,560
She seems a little two-faced.

43
00:03:10,910 --> 00:03:11,710
Right.

44
00:03:13,060 --> 00:03:14,680
She's still tangled up with

45
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:15,910
a bunch of guys.

46
00:03:16,650 --> 00:03:17,910
That's just how she is.

47
00:03:18,460 --> 00:03:19,150
Look.

48
00:03:19,180 --> 00:03:20,840
She's not doing very well now.

49
00:03:20,870 --> 00:03:22,120
She's just a little intern

50
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:23,450
who gets bossed around.

51
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:27,079
Unlike you,

52
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:29,280
who's already a publicity supervisor.

53
00:03:29,860 --> 00:03:30,910
You'll be a rich lady soon.

54
00:03:30,910 --> 00:03:32,280
Don't forget about me.

55
00:03:33,970 --> 00:03:35,680
No supervisors here,

56
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,740
we're all the same.

57
00:03:36,910 --> 00:03:38,250
You're just being modest.

58
00:03:38,250 --> 00:03:39,020
Du Gefei.

59
00:03:40,430 --> 00:03:41,200
I've got work to do.

60
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:42,460
Look around yourself.

61
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:43,960
I've been looking for you.

62
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:44,960
Why are you here?

63
00:03:45,470 --> 00:03:46,520
I'm sorry, Yuning.

64
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,150
I...

65
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:48,280
The guest for the interactive segment

66
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:48,780
can't make it.

67
00:03:48,780 --> 00:03:50,310
We need a new segment to fill in.

68
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:51,620
It needs to be interactive

69
00:03:51,620 --> 00:03:52,470
and entertaining.

70
00:03:52,470 --> 00:03:53,310
The subsequent agenda

71
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:53,870
needs to be adjusted.

72
00:03:53,870 --> 00:03:55,470
I want to see it in 15 minutes.

73
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:56,900
Fifteen minutes?

74
00:03:57,270 --> 00:03:59,000
Yes. We're running out of time.

75
00:03:59,140 --> 00:03:59,710
Right.

76
00:03:59,740 --> 00:04:01,470
The focus is on Light Chaser.

77
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:02,750
The total promo duration stays the same,

78
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:04,520
and there cannot be any dead air.

79
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,310
But...

80
00:04:05,310 --> 00:04:06,210
But what?

81
00:04:06,860 --> 00:04:07,870
Unexpected issues at events

82
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:08,910
are normal.

83
00:04:09,060 --> 00:04:10,390
Can you handle it or not?

84
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,310
I can.

85
00:04:16,269 --> 00:04:17,800
How am I supposed to do this?

86
00:04:17,860 --> 00:04:18,870
Fifteen minutes.

87
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,090
Drop what you're doing, Yun Li.

88
00:04:27,980 --> 00:04:28,860
Help me.

89
00:04:33,159 --> 00:04:34,570
Let's talk somewhere else.

90
00:04:34,570 --> 00:04:35,750
I'm busy right now.

91
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:37,860
Wait.

92
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,480
Wait.

93
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,860
You said we need to rework the event plan.

94
00:04:43,860 --> 00:04:44,750
Don't even get me started.

95
00:04:44,750 --> 00:04:45,860
The guest for the interactive segment

96
00:04:45,860 --> 00:04:46,720
bailed at the last minute.

97
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,560
The following segments are all canceled.

98
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,960
Yuning wants us to figure out

99
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:50,850
how to fix it.

100
00:04:52,250 --> 00:04:53,310
Us?

101
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,720
Or just you?

102
00:04:55,980 --> 00:04:57,560
What's the difference?

103
00:04:58,360 --> 00:05:00,130
Yun Li, just help me.

104
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,560
I'll treat you to dinner.

105
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,270
Sorry.

106
00:05:02,270 --> 00:05:03,010
I still have to hand out flyers.

107
00:05:03,010 --> 00:05:03,980
Ask someone else.

108
00:05:03,980 --> 00:05:05,680
You know Light Chaser best.

109
00:05:05,710 --> 00:05:06,280
This concerns

110
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:08,140
the whole publicity department.

111
00:05:08,950 --> 00:05:10,280
I'm very busy right now.

112
00:05:10,750 --> 00:05:11,560
Yun Li.

113
00:05:12,060 --> 00:05:13,070
This is your proposal.

114
00:05:13,070 --> 00:05:13,870
Now that something went wrong,

115
00:05:13,870 --> 00:05:15,730
you have to take responsibility.

116
00:05:15,870 --> 00:05:17,070
So now you admit this proposal

117
00:05:17,070 --> 00:05:17,950
was mine?

118
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,360
But this has nothing to do

119
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,510
with me anymore.

120
00:05:23,180 --> 00:05:25,180
You can't just leave me in the lurch.

121
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,250
You must have

122
00:05:27,250 --> 00:05:28,560
a backup plan, right?

123
00:05:32,450 --> 00:05:33,250
Fine.

124
00:05:33,250 --> 00:05:35,110
Then we'll just go down together.

125
00:05:35,510 --> 00:05:36,810
If the event is ruined,

126
00:05:37,750 --> 00:05:38,900
I'll tell everyone

127
00:05:38,930 --> 00:05:40,520
that your proposal had problems

128
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:42,180
and you refused to cooperate.

129
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:45,580
Du Gefei.

130
00:05:46,530 --> 00:05:47,530
I can help you,

131
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,810
but you have to agree to one condition.

132
00:05:50,980 --> 00:05:51,909
What condition?

133
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:54,940
After the event,

134
00:05:54,970 --> 00:05:56,250
you must publicly admit

135
00:05:56,250 --> 00:05:58,510
that I was the one who made this proposal.

136
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:01,480
If you don't agree,

137
00:06:02,370 --> 00:06:03,770
then handle it yourself.

138
00:06:03,990 --> 00:06:04,640
Anyway, right now,

139
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:05,720
I'm just an errand girl.

140
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,920
You are in charge of this event.

141
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,720
Whoever is in charge takes the blame.

142
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,950
Besides, you stole my proposal,

143
00:06:09,950 --> 00:06:11,810
and you still think you're right?

144
00:06:14,250 --> 00:06:15,060
Yun Li.

145
00:06:16,460 --> 00:06:17,570
I'm begging you.

146
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,280
If we can't pull off this segment,

147
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:22,780
we'll all lose face.

148
00:06:23,370 --> 00:06:24,720
Everyone has worked hard on Light Chaser

149
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,720
for so long.

150
00:06:26,270 --> 00:06:28,530
We can't let it fall apart
at the very end.

151
00:06:29,250 --> 00:06:31,420
Please, help me out,

152
00:06:32,650 --> 00:06:33,850
for everyone's sake.

153
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:37,800
As long as you promise,

154
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,930
after the event,

155
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,060
you will admit

156
00:06:40,060 --> 00:06:41,620
that I made this proposal.

157
00:06:43,370 --> 00:06:44,360
I promise.

158
00:06:59,190 --> 00:06:59,870
Yuning.

159
00:06:59,870 --> 00:07:01,600
Have you seen the new proposal?

160
00:07:03,540 --> 00:07:04,500
Great.

161
00:07:05,950 --> 00:07:07,310
Thank you, Yuning.

162
00:07:10,310 --> 00:07:11,980
Only you would believe it.

163
00:07:12,660 --> 00:07:13,950
I won't admit it.

164
00:07:45,810 --> 00:07:47,190
Next up is the Light Chaser

165
00:07:47,190 --> 00:07:48,750
trivia quiz segment.

166
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:51,250
The Light Chaser is set up with...

167
00:07:52,220 --> 00:07:54,159
The Light Chaser is equipped with advanced

168
00:07:54,159 --> 00:07:56,950
external sensors and millimeter...

169
00:07:57,390 --> 00:07:59,390
Millimeter-level precision...

170
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:02,250
Millimeter-level precision base stations.

171
00:08:03,250 --> 00:08:04,480
What even is this gibberish?

172
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:06,150
Who can memorize this?

173
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:10,950
Shize.

174
00:08:11,090 --> 00:08:13,240
I'm preparing today's schedule.

175
00:08:16,210 --> 00:08:17,670
Did you write it yourself?

176
00:08:18,620 --> 00:08:19,510
Of course.

177
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,560
I studied the Light Chaser

178
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,560
very thoroughly.

179
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:24,160
Really?

180
00:08:25,390 --> 00:08:26,600
If you had truly studied it

181
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,360
thoroughly,

182
00:08:28,310 --> 00:08:29,220
you wouldn't have been

183
00:08:29,220 --> 00:08:31,480
chatting with someone privately there.

184
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,360
I didn't.

185
00:08:33,929 --> 00:08:36,080
I've been memorizing the script here.

186
00:08:37,210 --> 00:08:39,870
Memorizing the script
that Yun Li wrote for you?

187
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,120
To ensure player safety,

188
00:08:45,750 --> 00:08:46,750
Light Chaser is equipped with

189
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:48,750
a comprehensive monitoring system.

190
00:08:48,750 --> 00:08:49,740
Every corner,

191
00:08:50,150 --> 00:08:51,350
every conversation,

192
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:53,600
is recorded crystal clear—

193
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:55,340
including your little chat

194
00:08:55,340 --> 00:08:56,470
with Yun Li just now.

195
00:08:58,250 --> 00:08:59,780
What are you talking about?

196
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,700
If you spent less time on scheming

197
00:09:01,750 --> 00:09:03,480
and just did your job honestly,

198
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:04,650
you wouldn't have

199
00:09:04,650 --> 00:09:06,180
made such a stupid mistake.

200
00:09:08,100 --> 00:09:08,910
Du Gefei.

201
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:13,470
I'm giving you two options.

202
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:14,890
Either

203
00:09:15,050 --> 00:09:16,850
you honor your promise to Yun Li.

204
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,150
At the celebration party,

205
00:09:18,150 --> 00:09:19,350
in front of everyone,

206
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,410
confess everything you've done.

207
00:09:21,410 --> 00:09:22,700
And the other option?

208
00:09:24,700 --> 00:09:25,700
The other option

209
00:09:27,890 --> 00:09:28,820
is to let this video

210
00:09:28,820 --> 00:09:30,280
do the confessing for you.

211
00:09:31,250 --> 00:09:31,960
You should know

212
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,290
which option

213
00:09:34,620 --> 00:09:35,890
is better for you.

214
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,460
Thank you all for coming.

215
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:53,900
The launch ceremony of our Light Chaser

216
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:56,730
officially begins now.

217
00:10:01,390 --> 00:10:02,390
Distinguished guests,

218
00:10:02,390 --> 00:10:03,220
hello everyone.

219
00:10:03,220 --> 00:10:04,890
Welcome to the promotional event

220
00:10:04,890 --> 00:10:06,460
for EAW Light Chaser,

221
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:08,000
Nanwu's first

222
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,410
VR experience center.

223
00:10:09,410 --> 00:10:11,200
I'm your host, Du Gefei.

224
00:10:39,010 --> 00:10:39,820
Ice water.

225
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:45,800
Thank you.

226
00:10:57,670 --> 00:10:58,480
What's wrong?

227
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:01,740
Are you okay?

228
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,410
About the proposal,

229
00:11:08,410 --> 00:11:10,140
I should've been more careful.

230
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:12,520
I'll just take it as a lesson learned.

231
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:17,870
But seeing the event go so smoothly,

232
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,270
I feel a bit comforted.

233
00:11:23,900 --> 00:11:26,190
As long as she admits after the event

234
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:28,340
that I made the proposal.

235
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,240
Don't worry.

236
00:11:36,670 --> 00:11:37,480
She will.

237
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:41,770
I hope so.

238
00:11:55,050 --> 00:11:56,740
This event was a big success.

239
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,700
Everyone has worked hard.

240
00:11:59,250 --> 00:12:00,580
The company has decided

241
00:12:00,750 --> 00:12:02,750
to give every member
of the publicity department

242
00:12:02,750 --> 00:12:03,840
a bonus

243
00:12:03,870 --> 00:12:04,930
as encouragement.

244
00:12:06,650 --> 00:12:08,440
Thank you, Boss!

245
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:11,240
Great!

246
00:12:12,030 --> 00:12:13,190
Thank you, Boss!

247
00:12:13,750 --> 00:12:14,750
It's not a huge amount,

248
00:12:14,750 --> 00:12:15,650
but I hope everyone

249
00:12:15,650 --> 00:12:16,960
will continue to work hard

250
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:18,200
and do your best

251
00:12:18,270 --> 00:12:19,220
in the future.

252
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:19,770
Alright!

253
00:12:19,770 --> 00:12:21,150
No problem!

254
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,550
Quiet down, everyone.

255
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:25,010
I'd like to say a few words.

256
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:25,860
I think

257
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:27,440
there's someone we should thank today.

258
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:29,150
Our hero of the day:

259
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:29,970
Feifei!

260
00:12:30,150 --> 00:12:32,150
She did a great job today.

261
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:34,000
I propose a toast to her.

262
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:34,530
Great!

263
00:12:34,530 --> 00:12:34,860
Cheers!

264
00:12:34,860 --> 00:12:36,440
Cheers!

265
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:38,440
Thanks to Feifei's great proposal,

266
00:12:38,460 --> 00:12:39,670
we all got to share

267
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:40,790
the credit.

268
00:12:40,790 --> 00:12:41,390
Right?

269
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:43,290
Yes, thanks to Feifei.

270
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:44,240
Feifei.

271
00:12:44,640 --> 00:12:45,530
For the next good project,

272
00:12:45,530 --> 00:12:46,550
count me in.

273
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,320
Not at all.

274
00:12:48,350 --> 00:12:49,360
You flatter me.

275
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:49,860
This wasn't

276
00:12:49,860 --> 00:12:50,840
my doing alone.

277
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,340
I also want to thank everyone
for your cooperation.

278
00:12:52,340 --> 00:12:53,670
Here, a toast to you all.

279
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:54,600
Come, Feifei.

280
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,000
Come on.

281
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,130
Cheers, everyone.

282
00:12:57,750 --> 00:12:58,880
Thank you, Ms. Fang.

283
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:00,830
-Thank you, Mr. Xu.
-Thank you.

284
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:05,630
Du Gefei.

285
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:08,200
Didn't we have an agreement?

286
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:10,500
What agreement?

287
00:13:11,460 --> 00:13:13,500
I don't understand what you mean.

288
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,460
I helped you revise your speech,

289
00:13:16,460 --> 00:13:16,950
and you...

290
00:13:16,950 --> 00:13:17,640
Yun Li.

291
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:20,700
I wrote the speech myself.

292
00:13:21,250 --> 00:13:22,650
Are you feeling alright?

293
00:13:28,130 --> 00:13:28,940
Du Gefei.

294
00:13:29,860 --> 00:13:32,190
You have something else to say, don't you?

295
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,820
Want me to jog your memory?

296
00:13:39,460 --> 00:13:41,460
If you don't want to say it yourself.

297
00:13:41,460 --> 00:13:42,520
