314
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,180
Ms. Fang.

315
00:14:26,460 --> 00:14:28,220
Today is a happy day.

316
00:14:28,250 --> 00:14:30,250
How about we talk about it tomorrow?

317
00:14:30,420 --> 00:14:31,470
Young people

318
00:14:31,980 --> 00:14:33,250
