459
00:21:16,270 --> 00:21:19,160
Find a quiet café.

460
00:21:19,550 --> 00:21:21,750
You look at the book, and he looks at you.

461
00:21:22,010 --> 00:21:23,480
The sunlight outside the window

462
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:25,810
