Anything is possible.

589
00:27:37,830 --> 00:27:39,050
We've known each other

590
00:27:39,050 --> 00:27:41,000
for a while now,

591
00:27:41,140 --> 00:27:42,540
so I guess we're friends.

592
00:27:43,030 --> 00:27:44,640
And friends can help each other

593
00:27:44,640 --> 00:27:45,790
find dates.

594
00:27:48,750 --> 00:27:49,810
What kind of dates?

595
00:27:56,090 --> 00:27:57,420
Someone good‑looking,

596
00:27:57,640 --> 00:27:58,590
quiet,

597
00:27:59,610 --> 00:28:01,200
shy around strangers,

598
00:28:01,570 --> 00:28:02,600
but open around you,

599
00:28:02,600 --> 00:28:04,400
and always orbiting around you.

600
00:28:04,400 --> 00:28:05,880
What do you think?

601
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:20,900
Look at this question.

602
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:22,500
This one's important.

603
00:28:45,840 --> 00:28:46,640
Lili,

604
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:48,450
do I still need to come over?

605
00:28:52,220 --> 00:28:53,180
Why not?

606
00:28:56,680 --> 00:28:58,900
I just didn't want to be a third wheel.

607
00:29:00,920 --> 00:29:01,740
Fu Zhengchu.

608
00:29:05,110 --> 00:29:05,910
Tell him

609
00:29:06,250 --> 00:29:07,310
if he doesn't come,

610
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:09,640
he'll have to do his homework on his own.

611
00:29:16,870 --> 00:29:18,130
Come over quickly.

612
00:29:29,550 --> 00:29:30,350
Focus.

613
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:36,370
Uncle,

614
00:29:36,400 --> 00:29:37,850
don't look at me like that.

615
00:29:37,850 --> 00:29:40,640
I'm thinking through the problem.

616
00:29:41,180 --> 00:29:41,550
Right.

617
00:29:41,550 --> 00:29:42,290
Staring at me like that

618
00:29:42,290 --> 00:29:43,150
will affect me.

619
00:29:54,860 --> 00:29:56,720
Don't look at me like that either.

620
00:29:56,830 --> 00:29:58,890
I feel like I'm in elementary school.

621
00:30:03,360 --> 00:30:04,070
All right.

622
00:30:05,220 --> 00:30:05,680
Here.

623
00:30:12,660 --> 00:30:14,500
Well, very good.

624
00:30:17,350 --> 00:30:18,350
Nice work, Lili.

625
00:30:19,330 --> 00:30:20,140
Uncle,

626
00:30:20,290 --> 00:30:21,400
could you take a look at

627
00:30:21,400 --> 00:30:22,460
this question too?

628
00:30:22,740 --> 00:30:23,530
Here.

629
00:30:25,400 --> 00:30:26,860
Kirchhoff's Current Law.

630
00:30:27,420 --> 00:30:28,700
Then this current value...

631
00:30:28,700 --> 00:30:30,090
The current flowing into this node

632
00:30:30,090 --> 00:30:31,030
equals the current

633
00:30:31,030 --> 00:30:32,030
flowing out of it.

634
00:30:32,030 --> 00:30:34,160
That makes this problem easy to solve.

635
00:30:35,610 --> 00:30:36,720
I see.

636
00:30:39,240 --> 00:30:40,530
If only you two were

637
00:30:40,530 --> 00:30:41,250
my parents,

638
00:30:41,250 --> 00:30:42,090
then I wouldn't be

639
00:30:42,090 --> 00:30:43,290
such a study slacker.

640
00:30:43,690 --> 00:30:45,350
It mainly depends on your dad.

641
00:30:54,400 --> 00:30:56,320
I-I-I'm going to the restroom.

642
00:31:08,960 --> 00:31:10,590
So awkward.

643
00:31:10,610 --> 00:31:12,290
Yun Li, why did you chime in?

644
00:31:22,940 --> 00:31:24,140
What a coincidence.

645
00:31:24,390 --> 00:31:25,870
We meet again.

646
00:31:28,730 --> 00:31:29,860
May I ask who you are?

647
00:31:30,310 --> 00:31:32,390
I'm Yun Li's high school classmate.

648
00:31:33,310 --> 00:31:34,440
Just... last time,

649
00:31:34,560 --> 00:31:35,800
I ran into you guys

650
00:31:35,830 --> 00:31:37,080
at the vintage market.

651
00:31:37,080 --> 00:31:38,270
Don't you remember?

652
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:40,510
Lili went to the restroom.

653
00:31:40,510 --> 00:31:41,180
How about this?

654
00:31:41,180 --> 00:31:42,810
Let me get you a drink,

655
00:31:42,880 --> 00:31:43,920
on Lili's behalf.

656
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:45,810
Sure.

657
00:31:46,070 --> 00:31:47,010
Thank you.

658
00:31:47,430 --> 00:31:48,360
This seat...

659
00:31:53,220 --> 00:31:55,570
I was waiting for a friend over there.

660
00:31:55,710 --> 00:31:57,750
I saw Yun Li chatting with you.

661
00:31:57,920 --> 00:32:00,070
I feel she's much more cheerful now.

662
00:32:00,310 --> 00:32:02,050
I'm quite happy for her.

663
00:32:04,600 --> 00:32:06,260
I was in a hurry last time,

664
00:32:06,290 --> 00:32:07,550
so we didn't talk much.

665
00:32:07,680 --> 00:32:09,110
I'd actually love to hear

666
00:32:09,110 --> 00:32:10,480
how Yun Li's doing these days.

667
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:12,540
How about we add each other on WeChat?

668
00:32:15,050 --> 00:32:17,660
How about you add mine?

669
00:32:18,670 --> 00:32:19,460
Sure.

670
00:32:19,680 --> 00:32:20,940
I'll scan your QR code.

671
00:32:22,070 --> 00:32:22,700
No need.

672
00:32:25,390 --> 00:32:26,660
How about

673
00:32:27,030 --> 00:32:28,260
you talk to Lili instead?

674
00:32:28,260 --> 00:32:30,920
It's been a while
since you two caught up, right?

675
00:32:31,540 --> 00:32:32,370
Yeah.

676
00:32:32,400 --> 00:32:33,770
We haven't been in touch

677
00:32:33,770 --> 00:32:35,530
since we graduated high school.

678
00:32:35,530 --> 00:32:37,140
But in high school,

679
00:32:37,140 --> 00:32:39,070
we were very close.

680
00:32:39,970 --> 00:32:41,790
Though Yun Li

681
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:44,440
mostly hung out with guys.

682
00:32:44,770 --> 00:32:46,510
I was her only female friend.

683
00:32:51,050 --> 00:32:52,110
Speaking of which,

684
00:32:52,510 --> 00:32:54,240
Yun Li was quite pitiful

685
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:55,720
in high school.

686
00:32:57,110 --> 00:32:58,570
Isn't she deaf

687
00:32:58,570 --> 00:32:59,640
in one ear?

688
00:33:01,160 --> 00:33:02,010
Lili...

689
00:33:04,960 --> 00:33:05,770
Yeah.

690
00:33:06,380 --> 00:33:07,270
During class,

691
00:33:07,270 --> 00:33:08,830
she couldn't hear the teacher clearly

692
00:33:08,830 --> 00:33:10,860
and was often made to stand.

693
00:33:13,220 --> 00:33:16,340
Later, I heard she didn't get
the postgraduate recommendation.

694
00:33:16,340 --> 00:33:17,170
Probably because

695
00:33:17,170 --> 00:33:18,900
she couldn't hear the teacher.

696
00:33:19,180 --> 00:33:21,680
But that wasn't even her fault.

697
00:33:22,040 --> 00:33:24,290
She's had trouble hearing since childhood

698
00:33:24,290 --> 00:33:25,960
and was often discriminated against

699
00:33:25,960 --> 00:33:28,200
because of it.

700
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:31,160
We gradually lost touch after that.

701
00:33:32,290 --> 00:33:33,650
But seeing her

702
00:33:33,680 --> 00:33:35,680
so happy with you guys,

703
00:33:36,660 --> 00:33:38,110
I'm quite relieved.

704
00:33:38,590 --> 00:33:40,440
You said you graduated
with your bachelor's

705
00:33:40,440 --> 00:33:41,570
and are working now?

706
00:33:41,640 --> 00:33:42,400
Yes.

707
00:33:42,400 --> 00:33:43,180
I'm currently at...

708
00:33:43,180 --> 00:33:45,310
Since you spoke ill of Yun Li last time,

709
00:33:45,440 --> 00:33:46,840
I've been very confused.

710
00:33:47,660 --> 00:33:49,860
You don't seem like an educated person.

711
00:33:50,900 --> 00:33:51,570
No,

712
00:33:51,570 --> 00:33:52,380
I was just hoping...

713
00:33:52,380 --> 00:33:54,180
Hoping we'd discover her flaws,

714
00:33:54,570 --> 00:33:55,070
right?

715
00:33:56,550 --> 00:33:57,750
I haven't found hers.

716
00:33:58,550 --> 00:34:00,010
Yours are pretty obvious.

717
00:34:09,210 --> 00:34:10,150
Yun Li.

718
00:34:11,010 --> 00:34:11,870
She's leaving.

719
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:20,820
Then I'll walk her out.

720
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:41,270
Y-Yun Li.

721
00:34:42,540 --> 00:34:43,389
I... I didn't

722
00:34:43,420 --> 00:34:45,230
want to bring this up,

723
00:34:45,230 --> 00:34:46,030
but

724
00:34:46,230 --> 00:34:47,300
your friends

725
00:34:47,420 --> 00:34:49,170
didn't seem to welcome me.

726
00:34:49,210 --> 00:34:50,170
What do you mean?

727
00:34:51,429 --> 00:34:53,409
I just chatted with them for a bit.

728
00:34:54,330 --> 00:34:55,530
Your friend has quite a temper,

729
00:34:55,530 --> 00:34:56,920
doesn't he?

730
00:35:00,510 --> 00:35:01,780
He has a temper?

731
00:35:04,320 --> 00:35:05,280
What did you say?

732
00:35:05,530 --> 00:35:07,230
I didn't say much.

733
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:10,740
We just talked about you
being made to stand before.

734
00:35:11,280 --> 00:35:11,800
I thought...

735
00:35:11,800 --> 00:35:12,630
You told them about

736
00:35:12,630 --> 00:35:13,690
my deaf left ear?

737
00:35:15,340 --> 00:35:16,010
I didn't expect

738
00:35:16,010 --> 00:35:17,340
that they didn't know.

739
00:35:17,820 --> 00:35:18,920
Besides,

740
00:35:18,920 --> 00:35:20,530
we've been classmates for so many years.

741
00:35:20,530 --> 00:35:21,320
I just wanted them

742
00:35:21,320 --> 00:35:22,230
to treat you better.

743
00:35:22,230 --> 00:35:22,780
I don't think

744
00:35:22,780 --> 00:35:23,940
telling my friends
about my past embarrassments

745
00:35:23,940 --> 00:35:25,670
is a good thing.

746
00:35:26,730 --> 00:35:27,630
Qu Mingxin.

747
00:35:27,780 --> 00:35:28,420
I really treated you

748
00:35:28,420 --> 00:35:29,950
as a good friend in the past.

749
00:35:30,570 --> 00:35:31,420
When you approached me

750
00:35:31,420 --> 00:35:32,230
and wanted to be my friend,

751
00:35:32,230 --> 00:35:33,380
I was very grateful.

752
00:35:34,880 --> 00:35:35,780
But I never expected

753
00:35:35,780 --> 00:35:37,340
that you led everyone to ostracize me.

754
00:35:37,340 --> 00:35:38,280
I was too young

755
00:35:38,280 --> 00:35:39,210
to stand up to you.

756
00:35:39,210 --> 00:35:40,570
I thought if I endured it, it would pass.

757
00:35:40,570 --> 00:35:42,370
But that's not how it turned out.

758
00:35:46,730 --> 00:35:47,480
Uncle.

759
00:35:47,840 --> 00:35:49,900
You were angry just now, weren't you?

760
00:35:50,980 --> 00:35:51,780
No.

761
00:35:52,900 --> 00:35:55,030
Actually, I never noticed

762
00:35:55,030 --> 00:35:56,670
that Lili has

763
00:35:56,670 --> 00:35:57,480
a deaf ear.

764
00:36:02,940 --> 00:36:04,420
Did you know it all along?

765
00:36:04,780 --> 00:36:05,940
No wonder every time we go out,

766
00:36:05,940 --> 00:36:07,390
you're always on her right side.

767
00:36:07,390 --> 00:36:08,500
Just like now.

768
00:36:12,820 --> 00:36:13,280
You...

769
00:36:23,990 --> 00:36:25,390
Your book's upside down.

770
00:36:28,320 --> 00:36:28,880
Here.

771
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:31,970
Complete this test.

772
00:36:46,630 --> 00:36:47,280
Hello?

773
00:36:47,300 --> 00:36:48,110
Tang Lin.

774
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:49,910
Yes, I'm studying.

775
00:36:51,840 --> 00:36:52,780
Do I have to come?

776
00:36:53,810 --> 00:36:55,100
Alright, I got it.

777
00:36:55,420 --> 00:36:56,920
I really can't do anything about you.

778
00:36:56,920 --> 00:36:57,710
Tangy?

779
00:36:58,880 --> 00:37:00,710
Something came up. I have to go.

780
00:37:00,710 --> 00:37:01,610
Keep studying, you two.

781
00:37:01,610 --> 00:37:02,610
I'm leaving. Bye.

782
00:37:02,940 --> 00:37:03,670
Fu Zhengchu.

783
00:37:04,280 --> 00:37:04,840
You...

784
00:37:06,760 --> 00:37:07,300
Bye.

785
00:37:10,880 --> 00:37:12,210
Let's do the test paper.

786
00:37:26,170 --> 00:37:27,170
This question...

787
00:37:41,160 --> 00:37:43,810
♪ Who is it by my ear ♪

788
00:37:43,840 --> 00:37:47,310
♪ Casting shouts into the dark night ♪

789
00:37:48,030 --> 00:37:52,810
♪ Filling every crack in the clouds ♪

790
00:37:54,440 --> 00:37:57,070
♪ Echoes folding into paper boats ♪

791
00:37:57,100 --> 00:38:00,630
♪ Drifting down the river,
around the shallows ♪

792
00:37:57,130 --> 00:37:58,590
You got angry at Qu Mingxin

793
00:37:58,610 --> 00:38:00,710
because of me, right?

794
00:38:01,090 --> 00:38:06,320
♪ Heading your way, with no turning back ♪

795
00:38:04,110 --> 00:38:07,630
It's the first time I've heard someone
say you have a bad temper.

796
00:38:07,630 --> 00:38:10,350
♪ Burying regrets deep in the soil ♪

797
00:38:10,370 --> 00:38:13,530
♪ Waiting for a meeting
to light up the loneliness ♪

798
00:38:10,780 --> 00:38:11,880
What do you look like

799
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:13,110
when you're angry?

800
00:38:13,670 --> 00:38:15,300
♪ Moonlight gently sways ♪

801
00:38:15,330 --> 00:38:17,050
♪ Stars fall upon my shoulder ♪

802
00:38:15,730 --> 00:38:16,880
I've never seen it.

803
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:17,940
What a pity.

804
00:38:17,080 --> 00:38:19,800
♪ Look at me ♪

805
00:38:19,830 --> 00:38:24,500
♪ The long night slows down ♪

806
00:38:24,990 --> 00:38:26,970
♪ The wounds kissed by the wind ♪

807
00:38:27,000 --> 00:38:28,390
♪ I remember them all ♪

808
00:38:28,420 --> 00:38:31,570
♪ Grains of sand count the depth
of every fall ♪

809
00:38:31,600 --> 00:38:33,900
♪ Still fearing the collision ♪

810
00:38:33,920 --> 00:38:37,170
♪ Like a scorching heat
on a cosmic scale ♪

811
00:38:37,010 --> 00:38:38,000
Fu Shize,

812
00:38:38,260 --> 00:38:40,230
are you pretending to be asleep?

813
00:38:38,340 --> 00:38:40,230
♪ Dreams folded by the rain ♪

814
00:38:40,260 --> 00:38:41,590
♪ Still crystal clear ♪

815
00:38:41,610 --> 00:38:44,850
♪ Clouds stitching up the colors
of every break ♪

816
00:38:44,870 --> 00:38:47,200
♪ Borrowing a beam of moonlight ♪

817
00:38:47,360 --> 00:38:50,370
♪ To smooth over the uneasy past ♪

818
00:38:50,390 --> 00:38:57,640
♪ Picking up scattered light
at my fingertips with you ♪

819
00:38:57,980 --> 00:38:58,940
Sorry, Mingxin.

820
00:38:58,940 --> 00:39:00,030
Something came up.

821
00:39:01,340 --> 00:39:02,540
You've already left?

822
00:39:03,780 --> 00:39:05,310
Let's meet up another time.

823
00:39:40,610 --> 00:39:42,010
-Yuan.
-Don't come over.

824
00:39:43,170 --> 00:39:43,920
Shize.

825
00:39:44,950 --> 00:39:46,610
Why did I ever have to meet you?

826
00:39:52,820 --> 00:39:53,530
Yuan!

827
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:56,550
Yuan!

828
00:40:22,340 --> 00:40:23,090
Shize.

829
00:40:24,090 --> 00:40:25,480
Just let me go.

830
00:40:25,530 --> 00:40:26,110
Yuan!

831
00:40:35,730 --> 00:40:36,980
Yuan!

832
00:40:55,300 --> 00:40:56,090
Sorry.

833
00:40:57,180 --> 00:40:58,000
I'm fine.

834
00:40:58,000 --> 00:41:00,110
Did... Did you have a nightmare?

835
00:41:00,110 --> 00:41:01,400
You don't look so good.

836
00:41:10,760 --> 00:41:11,550
Are you okay?

837
00:41:11,550 --> 00:41:12,360
I'm fine.

838
00:41:13,590 --> 00:41:14,520
It doesn't hurt.

839
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:26,000
Hello?

840
00:41:31,340 --> 00:41:31,980
What?

841
00:41:34,550 --> 00:41:35,190
Okay.

842
00:41:37,590 --> 00:41:39,050
Is something urgent?

843
00:41:40,550 --> 00:41:42,090
Someone in my family is sick.

844
00:41:42,090 --> 00:41:43,320
I need to get to the hospital.

845
00:41:43,320 --> 00:41:44,180
Go right ahead.

846
00:41:44,500 --> 00:41:45,800
I can go back by myself.

847
00:41:47,360 --> 00:41:48,290
I'm really fine.

848
00:41:49,960 --> 00:41:50,760
Sorry.
